                    </span>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
    <!-- ================= ANNOUNCEMENTS ================= -->

    <div class="col-xl-6">

        <div class="announcement-card">

            <!-- HEADER -->
            <div class="card-header-custom">

                <h4>Announcements</h4>

                <a href="#" class="action-link">
                    View all
                </a>

            </div>

            <!-- BODY -->
            <div class="announcement-wrapper">

                <!-- ITEM -->
                <div class="announcement-item">

                    <div class="announcement-icon blue-bg">
                        <i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="announcement-content">

                        <div class="announcement-top">

                            <h5>Company Town Hall Meeting</h5>

                            <span class="announcement-date">
                                Today
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Join the company-wide town hall meeting today at
                            4:00 PM in the main conference hall.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- ITEM -->
                <div class="announcement-item">

                    <div class="announcement-icon green-bg">
                        <i class="bi bi-trophy"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="announcement-content">

                        <div class="announcement-top">

                            <h5>Employee of the Month</h5>

                            <span class="announcement-date">
                                1 day ago
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Congratulations to Priya Patel from Engineering
                            for outstanding performance this month.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- ITEM -->
                <div class="announcement-item">

                    <div class="announcement-icon orange-bg">
                        <i class="bi bi-calendar-event"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="announcement-content">

                        <div class="announcement-top">

                            <h5>Holiday Notice</h5>

                            <span class="announcement-date">
                                2 days ago
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Office will remain closed on Friday due to the
                            national public holiday.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- ITEM -->
                <div class="announcement-item border-0 mb-0">

                    <div class="announcement-icon red-bg">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="announcement-content">

                        <div class="announcement-top">

                            <h5>Security Awareness Training</h5>

                            <span class="announcement-date">
                                3 days ago
                            </span>

                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Mandatory cybersecurity training session scheduled
                            for all employees next Monday.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</div>

